WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:00.850
Juri attempts a close throw before Chun-Li’s air-stomp punish.

2
00:00:00.850 --> 00:00:01.650
The air stomp catches Juri’s missed throw.

3
00:00:01.650 --> 00:00:02.050
Standing heavy kick links after landing.

4
00:00:02.050 --> 00:00:02.300
Standing medium punch follows the heavy kick.

5
00:00:02.300 --> 00:00:03.700
Crouching medium punch continues the grounded confirm.

6
00:00:03.700 --> 00:00:05.200
Heavy Spinning Bird Kick finishes the punish.

7
00:00:05.200 --> 00:00:05.600
Juri recovers after the throw-bait conversion.
